# galaga.vhd, gen_ram.vhd, mb88.vhd, sound_machine.vhd, stars.vhd, stars_machine.vhd:
# static tiles were corrupted on some starts: the core clock_18 and the scandoubler pixel
# enable came from separate dividers, so the pixel sample phase varied per start and could
# fall while the video mux output changes. The core, the 54xx MB88 core and the sound
# and stars machines run on one clk_core (36.864 MHz) with clock enables (ce18,
# ce18n) in place of clock_18 / clock_18n; ROM addresses are held per enable phase; the
# pixel enable is brought out as ce_pix for the scandoubler.
